  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T17:42:27.142808Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T17:50:47.260349Z",
  "totalBlocks": 134,
  "translatedBlocks": 134,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbfc0634fd736d13",
      "translationZh": "一个金融服务团队每周都要花费大量时间，根据季度报告、合规文档和市场分析手动制作面向客户的 PowerPoint 演示文稿。每份演示文稿都需要阅读数百页材料、提取关键数据点、组织幻灯片结构并生成配套视觉素材。本文将带你使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 构建一个 AI 智能体系统，自动完成这一工作流程；在我们的内部测试中，该系统能在 90 秒内完成任务。这种方法缩短了演示文稿的制作时间，同时确保内容以源文档为依据。该解决方案使用 Strands Agents 框架，在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能 AgentCore runtime 上部署一个主管智能体，以编排文档生成和摘要工具。Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.6（可在 Amazon Bedrock 上使用）负责内容创作，Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2 为向量搜索提供支持，Stability AI Stable Image Inpaint（可在 Amazon Bedrock 上使用）则生成幻灯片图像。本文还提供了一个包含代码资源的公开代码仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b633d370a683934",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime 上部署单个主管智能体，根据用户请求在文档生成工具和摘要工具之间进行选择。检索增强生成（RAG）流水线使用 Amazon OpenSearch Serverless，对多模态内容进行向量存储和语义搜索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d52d33de59cb11a",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案包含一个使用 .NET 8 minimal APIs 构建的 REST API，因此你可以通过标准 HTTP 调用与现有企业应用程序集成。AWS Lambda 提供无服务器计算，其中包括用于生成 PowerPoint 的容器化函数。该解决方案通过 Amazon Virtual Private Cloud（Amazon VPC）隔离、AWS Key Management Service（AWS KMS）加密以及 AWS Identity and Access Management（IAM）最小权限访问控制，保障实现方案的安全。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "485d4854562a16cf",
      "translationZh": "本节介绍 AgentCore runtime、RAG 和内容安全护栏在该解决方案中的应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8aeba4d062174574",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 进行智能体编排",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff77d8f78f079721",
      "translationZh": "单个 AI 智能体要根据大型知识库生成文档，就必须检索内容、组织大纲、生成文本、创建图像并组装文件。该解决方案并未在一个单体函数中实现这些相互竞争的职责，而是采用基于工具的架构，由主管智能体将请求路由到专门的工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85fcbd4dca584eb2",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime 提供了一个平台，可使用任意框架或模型，大规模构建、连接和优化智能体。智能体代码在隔离的容器中运行，并具备会话管理、内置身份和可观测性功能。该解决方案使用 Strands Agents 框架（一个用于构建 AI 智能体的开源 SDK）来实现主管逻辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d05da827928efbbe",
      "translationZh": "主管智能体对外提供两个工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e08ca7e7cb53f1ce",
      "translationZh": "generate_pptx：通过调用 PPTX Generator Lambda 函数创建 PowerPoint 演示文稿。该函数从知识库中检索内容、生成幻灯片大纲、创建 AI 图像，并组装最终文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8c8c1c3ac9aa641",
      "translationZh": "generate_summary：使用 RAG 从知识库中提取并综合信息，以提供准确、有据可依的回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3f78894e73ee309",
      "translationZh": "智能体会判断请求需要生成文档、总结内容，还是两者都需要，然后调用相应的工具。你可以在智能体代码中定义新工具来添加新功能，而无需修改现有工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f1be927c85257d4b",
      "translationZh": "面向企业知识的检索增强生成（RAG）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "508d3f2799527d57",
      "translationZh": "RAG 解决了 AI 系统中的一项根本性挑战：提供以企业数据为依据的准确、最新信息，而非仅依赖模型的训练数据。该实现使用 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases，将向量搜索与大语言模型（LLMs）相结合，在生成回答之前检索相关上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88ecddaf2fecaf04",
      "translationZh": "RAG 流水线的工作流程如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94a51f098941d842",
      "translationZh": "你将企业文档上传到 Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3)。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9932c0128513426b",
      "translationZh": "系统对文档进行分块和解析，并对表格、图表和图像等多模态内容进行特殊处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "163481c2d401333e",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2 将每个分块转换为捕捉语义含义的高维向量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7d4a3a97f2aa8a2",
      "translationZh": "Amazon OpenSearch Serverless 存储这些向量，创建可搜索的向量数据库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c596ced7d4b8664",
      "translationZh": "在查询时，系统将用户的请求转换为嵌入向量，并执行相似性搜索以检索相关的文档分块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "392e9f9be7158d86",
      "translationZh": "检索到的分块为语言模型提供上下文，语言模型据此生成以源材料为依据的响应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e8c359b6c7971bd",
      "translationZh": "这种方法旨在通过让生成的文档以企业知识库中的源信息为依据，帮助减少幻觉内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e2a7e915517fe67",
      "translationZh": "注意：Amazon OpenSearch Serverless 集合的数据平面必须保持可公开访问，因为 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 是从 AWS 管理的基础设施访问 Amazon OpenSearch Serverless，而不是通过客户的 VPC 端点访问。IAM 数据访问策略保护该集合，而仅限 VPC 的访问方式则限制对 Amazon OpenSearch Serverless 控制面板的访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f36d0da96bdb4711",
      "translationZh": "用于内容安全的 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d19801e623414110",
      "translationZh": "企业 AI 应用需要内容审核，以满足组织标准和合规要求。Amazon Bedrock Guardrails 提供内置的内容过滤和安全机制，并将其集成到整个文档生成流水线中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f96828368a1c40f",
      "translationZh": "护栏在多个阶段发挥作用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8bf23f62a89cd9c5",
      "translationZh": "输入处理：过滤用户请求，帮助防止注入问题和不当内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90c07689a31b74ab",
      "translationZh": "输出生成：监控模型输出，验证其是否符合内容策略。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa419567ad2463ce",
      "translationZh": "个人身份信息（PII）处理：检测 PII，并对其进行匿名化处理或阻止其传递。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50723f879a9461ce",
      "translationZh": "该实现通过 AWS Cloud Development Kit (AWS CDK) 创建自定义护栏，并配置专门针对企业文档创建需求定制的策略。智能体在模型调用层面应用护栏，提供一致的内容安全保障，无需为每次部署进行手动配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9501e119972b5971",
      "translationZh": "解决方案架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69d207af8f82b95c",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了基于智能体的文档生成系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "139cfdcdf56250e8",
      "translationZh": "图 1：Amazon Bedrock AgentCore RAG 演示文稿生成系统的架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e97a94920de60dc",
      "translationZh": "数据流始于通过 Amazon API Gateway 传入的用户请求，Amazon API Gateway 将这些请求路由到运行在 AWS Lambda 上、基于 .NET 的 Chat API。该 API 在 Amazon DynamoDB 中维护会话状态。随后，它调用托管在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时上的监督智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "336f27776329c0ed",
      "translationZh": "监督智能体分析请求并选择合适的工具。对于文档生成，它调用 PPTX Generator Lambda（一个容器化的 Python 函数）。对于摘要生成，监督智能体调用 Summary Generator Lambda，后者通过 retrieve_and_generate API 查询知识库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1201f0fbd1796cf1",
      "translationZh": "系统使用 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2 对存储在 Amazon S3 中的文档进行处理、分块并生成嵌入向量。Amazon OpenSearch Serverless 为这些嵌入向量建立索引，以实现快速语义搜索。当工具查询知识库时，Amazon OpenSearch Serverless 检索相关分块，然后将这些分块作为上下文提供给 Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.6（运行于 Amazon Bedrock），以生成有依据的回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa6d92f97c68a6ff",
      "translationZh": "系统将生成的文档存储在 Amazon S3 中，并返回预签名 URL 以供安全下载。安全措施包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7539151f35415971",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon API Gateway 上使用 AWS WAF，配合托管规则集和基于 IP 的速率限制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a20e4bdbb6420a3c",
      "translationZh": "使用采用 Plus 功能计划并启用高级安全模式的 Amazon Cognito，提供威胁防护。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e32333e6fd7d774",
      "translationZh": "通过 AWS CDK 配置 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails，以实现一致的内容过滤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e1ba53f6de7da02",
      "translationZh": "使用启用时间点恢复、删除保护以及客户管理的 AWS KMS 加密的 Amazon DynamoDB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b78ddc04a9a41843",
      "translationZh": "启用版本控制、服务器访问日志记录和阻止公共访问的 Amazon S3 存储桶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f790b6e88d68ce7",
      "translationZh": "在 Lambda 函数上启用 AWS X-Ray 跟踪，以进行分布式调试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0beff8a68c166493",
      "translationZh": "通过基于正则表达式的租户 ID 和会话 ID 校验来验证输入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02c40171bc3f5f35",
      "translationZh": "通过为每个租户使用 AWS Security Token Service (AWS STS) 进行角色代入，实现租户隔离。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11f7a184b5c5ce41",
      "translationZh": "部署之前，您需要在环境中配置好以下工具和访问权限：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "964e857fd1d31a61",
      "translationZh": "一个具有基础设施部署权限的有效 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ddd57bc34306fd3",
      "translationZh": "已配置凭证的 AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI)。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7a76e5eaee00de5",
      "translationZh": "具有适当服务访问策略的 IAM 角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "171daa1369968498",
      "translationZh": ".NET SDK 8，并已全局安装 Amazon.Lambda.Tools。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f00a99cc7d38d0f",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.12 或更高版本，用于 AWS CDK 和 Lambda 函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "34fe83cadae84f17",
      "translationZh": "Node.js 和 AWS CDK CLI，用于基础设施部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4214dcce106a4cfd",
      "translationZh": "Docker 或 Finch，用于构建容器镜像（需要支持 ARM64）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7de97ee2db71fbe0",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock，并已获得 Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.6、Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2 和 Stability AI Stable Image Inpaint（可通过 Amazon Bedrock 使用）的模型访问权限。有关各区域的模型可用性，请参阅“Amazon Bedrock 中按 AWS 区域划分的受支持模型”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fd20923cb1df976",
      "translationZh": "已在您的账户中启用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b136e37be2a3bf3",
      "translationZh": "Amazon API Gateway 区域 REST API 的集成超时已配置为至少 300 秒。默认值为 29 秒。有关更多信息，请参阅“API Gateway 配额”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7f203788cb805dd",
      "translationZh": "一个已有的 Amazon VPC，其中包含私有子网。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff2de4919f7c9ca9",
      "translationZh": "一个用于存储部署构件的 Amazon S3 存储桶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82c6f58250e93c79",
      "translationZh": "设置过程包括配置部署参数和初始化 AWS CDK 环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d27b450542c59f24",
      "translationZh": "克隆代码仓库并进入项目目录：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "96a0f54a72b6790b",
      "translationZh": "在代码仓库根目录创建配置文件 pipeline-params.ini：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dbcd1fb6dc65cd0",
      "translationZh": "将 awscliprofile 设置为你的 AWS CLI 配置文件名称，或留空以使用环境变量中的凭证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7c220721eb782dc",
      "translationZh": "引导初始化 AWS CDK（每个账户和区域仅需执行一次）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ff404a75ef207a5",
      "translationZh": "这会创建 AWS CDK 部署所需的 AWS CloudFormation CDKToolkit 堆栈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc8a8d62cfdcf5b3",
      "translationZh": "为构建脚本添加可执行权限：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0043558fa387432c",
      "translationZh": "部署包含三个阶段：构建制品、部署基础设施，以及部署 AgentCore 运行时智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86aa1145680d9780",
      "translationZh": "构建阶段会编译应用程序代码，并打包部署制品。运行构建脚本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9f2564d5d19e61d",
      "translationZh": "这会编译 .NET 项目（Chat API），并将其打包为 Lambda 部署包。它使用 Docker 或 Finch 构建 PPTX Generator 容器镜像，并向 Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) 进行身份验证。随后，它会推送容器镜像，并将构建制品存储在 asset-output 目录中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "156359f96a5a19c7",
      "translationZh": "基础设施部署阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a1f53b21949c04c",
      "translationZh": "基础设施部署会创建 AWS 资源并配置服务集成。运行部署脚本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fa7d63f3b69956d",
      "translationZh": "部署会按照依赖顺序创建四个 AWS CloudFormation 堆栈：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1bdb0ad85e5676ba",
      "translationZh": "VPCEndpointsStack：为包括 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 在内的 AWS 服务配置 Amazon VPC 端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ff24b0c8e3c0837",
      "translationZh": "OpensearchStack：预置用于向量存储的 Amazon OpenSearch Serverless 集合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57cb9aec865d17f2",
      "translationZh": "AgentCoreStack：创建护栏、Lambda 函数和 IAM 角色，并将配置存储在 AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59f2665a60ab9cec",
      "translationZh": "ChatApiStack：部署 Amazon API Gateway 和 Chat API Lambda。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "588f3e438da4c9a1",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 运行时部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33329ce9c0f96a5a",
      "translationZh": "部署基础设施堆栈后，将监督智能体部署到 AgentCore 运行时：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3eecc2bcb169106f",
      "translationZh": "此脚本会构建监督智能体容器（ARM64），将其推送到 Amazon ECR，创建 AgentCore 运行时和端点，并使用端点的 Amazon Resource Name（ARN）更新 Systems Manager 参数。Chat API 引用此端点 ARN，将请求路由到智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aab9cdc3449a8b4d",
      "translationZh": "部署后，AWS CloudFormation 的输出包括 Amazon API Gateway 端点 URL 和资源标识符。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98650925a6e7d274",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案提供了多个配置点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcf817f25a0f6047",
      "translationZh": "编辑 agent/app.py 以修改监督智能体的系统提示词和行为。该智能体使用 Strands Agents，并配有在 agent/tools.py 中定义的两个工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da1c68e15cbddb61",
      "translationZh": "generate_pptx：调用 PPTX Generator Lambda 来创建文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b22f0bb35a70d62",
      "translationZh": "generate_summary：调用 Summary Generator Lambda 来执行知识库查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0280664b90c40a13",
      "translationZh": "在 pipeline-params.ini 中，调整模型标识符：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d23f63f8521dc20b",
      "translationZh": "ParsingInferenceProfileId：用于知识库文档解析的模型（推荐使用 Anthropic Claude Haiku 4.5，以提高成本效益）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f167da11baa29c0",
      "translationZh": "AgentInferenceProfileId：用于智能体推理的模型（推荐使用 Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.6）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9ba4a4643035a9e",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingModelId：用于向量搜索的嵌入模型（Amazon Titan Text Embeddings v2）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a041c1d9874dfe88",
      "translationZh": "ImageGenerationModelId：用于幻灯片图像生成的模型（Stability AI Stable Image Inpaint）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34413ba792c8719e",
      "translationZh": "使用推理配置文件而非直接使用模型 ID，可使请求利用更广泛的多区域容量池，从而提高吞吐量，并有助于在负载下保持性能稳定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d5d7a0f6d0a8d223",
      "translationZh": "Lambda 配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a580bc3d400aa913",
      "translationZh": "在堆栈文件中调整计算资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae5d53041642cb60",
      "translationZh": "Chat API：128 MB 内存，29 秒超时，预留并发量为 100（位于 api.py）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "acdf56c0595bd6bf",
      "translationZh": "PPTX Generator：900 MB 内存，300 秒超时，预留并发量为 50（位于 pptx_gen.py）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77cd2480f17dfcfc",
      "translationZh": "Summary Generator：512 MB 内存，300 秒超时，预留并发量为 50（位于 sum_gen.py）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16d82d1075461da7",
      "translationZh": "在使用一份 90 页的 Amazon 2024 年度报告 PDF 进行内部测试时，该解决方案取得了以下性能指标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0a950d054c9fe3c8",
      "translationZh": "演示文稿生成时间：端到端耗时 70–90 秒（包括知识库检索、内容生成、图像创建和文件组装）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3bc765c7d4ecd8d7",
      "translationZh": "幻灯片数量：六张幻灯片，包含标题、项目符号要点、图像+文本、纯图像和关键结论等版式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75e062c48169b7e0",
      "translationZh": "图像生成：使用 Stability AI Stable Image Inpaint 为每份演示文稿生成两张 AI 图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3b920c3e81e2836",
      "translationZh": "每次生成的成本：在撰写本文时，us-east-1 中的模型调用成本约为 0.04（包括文本和图像生成，其中图像生成占成本的大部分）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a31246832a89f4c",
      "translationZh": "知识库摄取：处理单个 1.3 MB 的 PDF 文档耗时不到 2 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b73f0ccc4691f5a9",
      "translationZh": "PowerPoint 演示文稿",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e665efd5f26ae6c4",
      "translationZh": "以下各图展示了生成的演示文稿中的幻灯片示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b6e2c5640ff7479",
      "translationZh": "图 2：生成的标题幻灯片，支持自定义品牌元素",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
