    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "652f41cb03705eec",
      "translationZh": "图 5：生成的内容幻灯片，概述盈利能力指标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bbfc06012c3faeb",
      "translationZh": "图 6：生成的纯图片幻灯片，包含一幅 AI 生成的图像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea414c6dfc72889a",
      "translationZh": "图 7：生成的要点总结幻灯片",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d8c93864ad57d56",
      "translationZh": "生成的演示文稿包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "067d08786e0524fd",
      "translationZh": "带有可自定义品牌元素的标题幻灯片。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c8e2c242a61a735",
      "translationZh": "包含项目符号要点和结构化文本的内容幻灯片。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6721b706950cbb9d",
      "translationZh": "图片幻灯片，其中的 AI 生成图像来自 Stability AI Stable Image Inpaint（在 Amazon Bedrock 上运行）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "14dc192902598b98",
      "translationZh": "提供演示指导的演讲者备注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ffd7962a7a6efc9f",
      "translationZh": "基于企业模板的统一格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae3f5806fba7d54b",
      "translationZh": "提供给知识库的摘要输出包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c62e6d05860b7a4d",
      "translationZh": "对知识库内容的简明综合概述。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4dec3647db3153d2",
      "translationZh": "追踪引用至源文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ca5eefde6aaa601",
      "translationZh": "采用结构化格式，突出关键要点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72c523f189c3b1c7",
      "translationZh": "通过流式响应向用户提供实时反馈。由于内部测试显示，演示文稿生成需要 70–90 秒（超过了 Amazon API Gateway 默认的 29 秒集成超时），Chat API 采用异步调用模式。请使用流式传输或轮询来接收最终结果，而不是等待同步 REST 调用返回。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f22d8932f4a72e45",
      "translationZh": "在多轮对话中维护对话上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87ef491c58e67c16",
      "translationZh": "用于文档下载的 Amazon S3 预签名 URL（5 分钟后过期）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0228681f58b2b6c6",
      "translationZh": "生成的内容在交付前会经过 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails 验证，以确认其符合内容政策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "220cbc4a0acb6d88",
      "translationZh": "为避免持续产生费用，请删除已部署的资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d066cf6be9cea3d",
      "translationZh": "删除 AgentCore 运行时和端点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48d347db2313e0f9",
      "translationZh": "关闭 Amazon DynamoDB 删除保护（删除堆栈前必须执行）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
